docs/kcycle_trifecta_rule_search_results.md:1:# KCYCLE trifecta rule search
docs/kcycle_trifecta_rule_search_results.md:14:Interpretation: xdom recipes are evaluated in the KCYCLE trifecta harness, but current 50%+ holdout passes remain low-sample strong-favorite slices. No candidate is promoted unless every holdout year has n >= 10.
docs/oracle_migration_runbook.md:3:Strategy Arena should run from an Oracle Korea region host when live KCYCLE odds are required. Render is retired from the live-odds path because it has no Korea region and can leave `market_used=false` during live race windows.
docs/oracle_migration_runbook.md:71:| Render region cannot reach KCYCLE | App runs in OCI Korea region with `KCYCLE_ENABLED=1`. |
docs/oracle_migration_runbook.md:72:| Live odds silently unavailable | `/api/live-decision` exposes `market_used`, `market_risk`, and signal payloads. |
docs/oracle_migration_runbook.md:80:| Missing production env | `deploy.sh` resolves the local data.go.kr key, uploads `.env.oracle`, and stops if the key is unavailable. |
