mobile/DESIGN.md:83:- Korean labels must fit within small controls without truncating meaning.
mobile/DESIGN.md:84:- Do not use emoji as icons; use vector line icons or text labels.
mobile/DESIGN.md:110:- Lists must remain scan-friendly: label left, value right, explanation below.
mobile/DESIGN.md:119:- **Accessibility**: card actions must expose a role and label.
mobile/DESIGN.md:123:- **Structure**: compact pill with optional dot and uppercase/caption label.
mobile/DESIGN.md:127:- **Accessibility**: text never color-only; label includes semantic state.
mobile/DESIGN.md:131:- **Structure**: label row, fixed-height rail, percentage.
mobile/DESIGN.md:133:- **Spacing**: space2 between label and rail.
mobile/DESIGN.md:146:- **Primary action**: `모델 신호 보기` is a high-contrast vermillion button with an analytics icon and explicit accessibility label.
mobile/DESIGN.md:161:- **Accessibility**: every row includes a combined label so the source data is readable without relying on model picks.
mobile/DESIGN.md:172:### MarketOddsBoard
mobile/DESIGN.md:173:- **Structure**: market-source board for win, quinella/exacta, and trifecta odds: code/label left, selection and odds right, change text below in detailed mode.
mobile/DESIGN.md:177:- **Accessibility**: every row exposes label, selection, odds, and change text in one readable label.
mobile/DESIGN.md:181:- **Structure**: three fixed tabs with line icons and labels.
mobile/DESIGN.md:195:- **Structure**: full-screen dim overlay with a raised advertising confirmation panel, policy-safe label, sponsor placeholder copy, primary confirm button, and quiet cancel button.
mobile/DESIGN.md:199:- **Accessibility**: visible title says this is an advertising gate, not a betting recommendation; confirm and cancel are buttons with explicit labels.
